# What EAS Build uploads. When this file exists it REPLACES .gitignore for that
# decision, which is the whole point of having it.
#
# assets/exercise-media/ is deliberately absent from this list. It is git-ignored
# (© Gym visual, not redistributable, must never be committed) but it does have to
# reach the builder, or the app ships with the drawn stick figures and none of the
# 1,305 demonstrations. Without this file EAS reads .gitignore, skips the folder,
# and produces a build that is missing 163 MB of the thing you asked for.
#
# Keep this in step with .gitignore for everything EXCEPT that folder.

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
/android/
/ios/
*.log
.env*
*.db
*.db-journal
backups/
.DS_Store
